{"id":"1edb9c65c85c539f","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language.md","title":"Abstract Language for Incompleteness","display":"df-abstract-incompleteness-language — Abstract Language for Incompleteness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language","aliases":["92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language"],"display":"df-abstract-incompleteness-language — Abstract Language for Incompleteness","source":"第 I 章，pp. 5–6、12（PDF 22–23、29）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-abstract-incompleteness-language — Abstract Language for Incompleteness"},{"key":"source","html":"第 I 章，pp. 5–6、12（PDF 22–23、29）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>：候选九元组；以下所有集合、函数与量词处于元语言。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IncLang}\">\\(\\mathrm{IncLang}\\)</span>：下文定义的九元组结构谓词；其定义条件不作为独立假设。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}language}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\\\\\n&amp;\\land |E|=\\aleph_0\\land S\\subseteq E\\land P,R,T\\subseteq S\\land H\\subseteq E\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Phi:E\\times\\mathbb N\\to E\\land\\Phi[H\\times\\mathbb N]\\subseteq S\\\\\n&amp;\\land g:E\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\land d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in E\\;d(g(X))=g(\\Phi(X,g(X)))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}language}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\\\\\n&amp;\\land |E|=\\aleph_0\\land S\\subseteq E\\land P,R,T\\subseteq S\\land H\\subseteq E\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Phi:E\\times\\mathbb N\\to E\\land\\Phi[H\\times\\mathbb N]\\subseteq S\\\\\n&amp;\\land g:E\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\land d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in E\\;d(g(X))=g(\\Phi(X,g(X)))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,S,P,R,H,T\">\\(E,S,P,R,H,T\\)</span> 分别是表达式、句子、可证句、可反驳句、谓词表达式、真句集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(X,n)\">\\(\\Phi(X,n)\\)</span> 是原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X(n)\">\\(X(n)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 在这一层独立给定，不预设否定算子，也不预设真句的可计算性。</p>\n<p>原书先取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 为到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 的双射；这里采用第 I 章练习 5 的单射推广，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 在非法码上可任意取值。合法码上的条件唯一确定其对角值；取非法码值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 即给出一个全扩张。它与本库算术系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 不是同一个对象。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 I 章，pp. 5–6、12（PDF 22–23、29）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IncLang}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}language}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\\\\\n&\\land |E|=\\aleph_0\\land S\\subseteq E\\land P,R,T\\subseteq S\\land H\\subseteq E\\\\\n&\\land\\Phi:E\\times\\mathbb N\\to E\\land\\Phi[H\\times\\mathbb N]\\subseteq S\\\\\n&\\land g:E\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\land d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\in E\\;d(g(X))=g(\\Phi(X,g(X)))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E,S,P,R,H,T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi(X,n)","display":false},{"tex":"X(n)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1875,"backlinks":[{"id":"8dcd8ee3e47cef44","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"73782856c9b2f46a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"935ae20b7597689e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language]] → [[92-df-abstract-expressibility]] → [[92-df-diagonal-pullback]] → [[92-lem-abstract-diagonal]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language]]"}],"outgoing":[]}